window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Experience the horror. Survive the madness. Join The Last Wardens.</b></p> <p>Bleakwood, Oregon—once a sleepy, forgotten town—has become ground zero for an unspeakable horror. When Danielle Pryer’s long-lost brother, Bruce, returns from the Vietnam War carrying a monstrous mutation, reality itself begins to unravel. Vines turn to veins, brick to bone, and the laws of physics become mere suggestions. But Bleakwood’s nightmare is just beginning.</p> <p>Enter The Last Wardens—a ragtag band of dysfunctional misfits, bound not by duty, but by desperation. Led by the enigmatic and unpredictable Riddle (Felicia Day), this team of barely-held-together creatures, survivors, and cynics are humanity’s last defense against a cosmic force older than time itself. From flesh-warping dimensional rifts to grotesque mutations lurking in the dark, they’re the only thing standing between Earth and annihilation.</p> <p>Danny (Anjali Bhimani), a resourceful sharpshooter with nothing left to lose, is thrust into the chaos, forced to navigate the dangerous world of the Wardens, where trust is a luxury and survival is an art form. Alongside the volatile, tentacle-wielding Worm (Mark Meer), the shadow-wracked Cyra (Shiva Negar), and the stone-skinned behemoth Bricks, Danny must uncover the dark secrets behind her brother’s transformation—before it's too late.</p> <p>Blending nostalgic adventure, dark humor, and pulse-pounding action, The Last Wardens Full-Cast Audio Drama delivers a thrilling mix of comic book fantasy and supernatural intrigue.</p> <p><b>Starring:</b></p> <p>Anjali Bhimani (Overwatch, Ms. Marvel) as Danielle Pryer</p> <p>Felicia Day (The Guild, Supernatural) as Riddle</p> <p>Mark Meer (Mass Effect) as Worm</p> <p>Shiva Negar (The Cuban) as Cyra</p> <p>Matthew Waterson (Transformers: War for Cybertron) as Keith Doyle</p> <p>Ginny Di (D&amp;D) as Laura Olsen</p>"; 
